# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only AI agent tooling.
#
# These paths hold agent definitions, skills, runtime settings, the harness's
# own specs and its configuration. They must stay available in the working tree
# but are never tracked or published. Application code, CI and shared project
# documentation live in src/, .github/ and docs/ and are deliberately not
# listed. `.agents/` above is the same policy, kept where it already was.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
